{"id":"853911eb6042f48c","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-hamilton-to-one-two-tsp.md","title":"Hamilton 圈到 1/2 权值旅行商的归约","display":"thm-hamilton-to-one-two-tsp — Hamilton 圈到 1/2 权值旅行商的归约","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-hamilton-to-one-two-tsp","aliases":["73-thm-hamilton-to-one-two-tsp"],"display":"thm-hamilton-to-one-two-tsp — Hamilton 圈到 1/2 权值旅行商的归约","depends_on":["[[73-df-hamilton-cycle-languages]]","[[73-df-weighted-tour-language]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§10.4.5, print pp. 471–473; PDF pp. 493–495","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":10},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-hamilton-to-one-two-tsp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-hamilton-to-one-two-tsp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hamilton-to-one-two-tsp — Hamilton 圈到 1/2 权值旅行商的归约"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d5866f606e95cdcc\" href=\"?note=d5866f606e95cdcc\" title=\"73-df-hamilton-cycle-languages\">73-df-hamilton-cycle-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aa25b0fd9e2cf41e\" href=\"?note=aa25b0fd9e2cf41e\" title=\"73-df-weighted-tour-language\">73-df-weighted-tour-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§10.4.5, print pp. 471–473; PDF pp. 493–495"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"10"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\">\\(\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge3\">\\(n\\ge3\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in V_n\">\\(i,j\\in V_n\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W_E(i,j)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0,&amp;i=j,\\\\1,&amp;i\\ne j\\land\\{i,j\\}\\in E,\\\\2,&amp;i\\ne j\\land\\{i,j\\}\\notin E.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W_E(i,j)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0,&amp;i=j,\\\\1,&amp;i\\ne j\\land\\{i,j\\}\\in E,\\\\2,&amp;i\\ne j\\land\\{i,j\\}\\notin E.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GCode}^U(n,E)\\in\\mathsf{UHC}\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TWCode}(n,W_E,n)\\in\\mathsf{TSP}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GCode}^U(n,E)\\in\\mathsf{UHC}\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TWCode}(n,W_E,n)\\in\\mathsf{TSP}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>任意巡回有 n 条正权边，总权≤n 当且仅当每条权都为 1，恰好使用原图边。W_E 还满足三角不等式：任一非对角权≤2，而两条正边之和≥2；因此同一归约也给度量版 TSP 的困难性。n&lt;3 的合法否实例及非法码可统一映到固定否 TSP 实例。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-hamilton-cycle-languages","status":"resolved","id":"d5866f606e95cdcc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-hamilton-cycle-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-weighted-tour-language","status":"resolved","id":"aa25b0fd9e2cf41e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-weighted-tour-language]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge3","display":false},{"tex":"i,j\\in V_n","display":false},{"tex":"W_E(i,j)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0,&i=j,\\\\1,&i\\ne j\\land\\{i,j\\}\\in E,\\\\2,&i\\ne j\\land\\{i,j\\}\\notin E.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{GCode}^U(n,E)\\in\\mathsf{UHC}\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TWCode}(n,W_E,n)\\in\\mathsf{TSP}.","display":true}],"bytes":1422,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-274","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-hamilton-to-one-two-tsp|Hamilton 圈到 1/2 权值旅行商的归约]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"f6386d790ff0500e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["d5866f606e95cdcc","aa25b0fd9e2cf41e"]}